Package: rcef
Type: Package
Title: Discard Raising and Length/Age Catch Allocation over CEF (RDBES) Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Damian", "Villagra", email = "damian.villagra@ilvo.vlaanderen.be",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yves", "Reecht", role = "aut",
           comment = "RDBESStockCoord functions, vendored (see R/RDBESStockCoord_*.R)"),
    person("RDBESStockCoord contributors", role = "ctb", comment = "ICES WG"))
Description: Implements the ICES discard-raising and length/age catch
    allocation workflows over CEF (RDBES) long-format data: discard-rate
    and sampling-coverage tables with the plots that draw them, strata
    construction, sampling-status classification, automatic and manual
    definition of raising/allocation groups, and the emission of a
    reproducible script or ICES TAF script set. Wraps the RDBESStockCoord
    engines catchRaising() and catchAllocationAoL().
